<title>USA: U.S. Filter completes Wheelabrator EOS deal.</title>
<headline>U.S. Filter completes Wheelabrator EOS deal.</headline>
<dateline>PALM DESERT, Calif. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Filter Corp on Thursday said it completed the acquisition of Wheelabrator EOS Inc, a unit of Wheelabrator Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>U.S. Filter said it acquired the company for 2,291,059 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>U.S. Filter shares were trading at 30-3/4, down 1/8, early Thursday afternoon.</p>
<p>EOS, which manages water, wastewater and groundwater treatment facilities for both the municipal and industrial markets, expects 1997 revenues of about $65 million. U.S. Filter said the acquisition would be accretive to earnings.</p>
</text>
